        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    principal = 500000\n    interest_rate = 0.04\n    periods = 20\n    annuity_due = False\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    if interest_rate == 0:\n        payment = principal / periods\n    else:\n        factor = (1 + interest_rate) ** periods\n        payment = principal * (interest_rate * factor) / (factor - 1)\n        if annuity_due:\n            payment /= (1 + interest_rate)\n\n    answer = round(payment)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
